        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-13T19:28:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I suppose there's no point in asking why, if the Boss ship is just about destruction (not baking), the other probe with the baking was even included in the background? &nbsp;Sounds like we'll never encounter it, so its only effect is to confuse things and make the ferocious one we <em>will</em> encounter seem more ridiculous. &nbsp;Maybe a little editing could tighten up that story a bit.</p>",
