        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-13T19:32:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What is the point of even mentioning the first probe and the galactic bake off? Seems to me the 2nd probe could have gone rouge in the narrative without going into that other stuff.&nbsp;</p><p>So, it's either that this game will be a little \"zanny\" thematically (not opposed to that nessesarily) or the 1st probe will be important to the narrative later on. Maybe a gnomish pastry chef will be our first expansion pilot.&nbsp;</p><p>Im laughing pretty hard right now. It's a mix of confusion and my continuing anticipation to play this thing.&nbsp;</p>",
